DATA NOTICE

This license covers the SOFTWARE (site/index.html, site/serve.py, scripts and
documentation) only.  It does NOT cover the question-bank data.

The question stems, answers and mark schemes distributed in site/data/*.js are
derived from publicly available past examination papers.  The copyright in
those materials belongs to the respective awarding bodies, including but not
limited to:

  - Cambridge Assessment International Education (CAIE)   — CIE 9709, CIE 9231
  - Pearson Edexcel                                       — Edexcel IAL
  - United Kingdom Mathematics Trust (UKMT)               — SMC, BMO
  - Cambridge Assessment Admissions Testing               — TMUA, ESAT

The data is provided for personal, non-commercial educational use only.
No original examination paper images (scans or screenshots) are included in
this repository.  If you redistribute or reuse this data, you are solely
responsible for obtaining the necessary permission from the relevant awarding
body.
